"The unused replacement password could not be removed from Keychain." = "未使用的新密码未能从钥匙串中清除。";
"A password is saved in Keychain. Leave this field blank to keep it." = "钥匙串中已有密码，留空即可保留。";
"Remove saved password when saving" = "保存时移除已有密码";
"Check server reachability" = "检查服务器可达性";
