// Mount request diagnostics
"Mount timed out while waiting for macOS or the server. Automatic retries are paused; try mounting again manually." = "等待 macOS 或服务器响应时挂载超时。已暂停自动重试，请手动重试挂载。";
"The saved password could not be read from Keychain. Allow access, unlock Keychain, or save the password again." = "无法从钥匙串读取已保存的密码。请允许访问、解锁钥匙串，或重新保存密码。";
"The previous mount request is still pending in macOS. Automatic retries are paused; the macOS network service may need to be restarted." = "上一次挂载请求仍在 macOS 中等待。已暂停自动重试，可能需要重启 macOS 网络认证服务。";

// Diagnostics
"Diagnostics" = "诊断";
"Share diagnostic data" = "共享诊断数据";
"About diagnostic data" = "关于诊断数据";
"Enabled by default; you can turn this off. Sends crash reports, error codes, app/OS versions and operation timing to Sentry in the US. Passwords, usernames, server addresses, share paths and MAC addresses are excluded. Sentry processes the connection IP address; IP and inferred location are scrubbed on the server. Turning this off stops new collection and attempts to delete the local diagnostic cache. Reports already queued may still be delivered; reports already sent cannot be recalled." = "默认开启，可随时关闭：向位于美国的 Sentry 发送崩溃报告、错误代码、应用和系统版本及操作耗时。不含密码、用户名、服务器地址、共享路径或 MAC 地址。Sentry 会处理连接 IP，IP 和推导的位置在服务端清洗。关闭后停止新采集，并尝试删除本地诊断缓存；已排队的报告仍可能送达，已发送的报告无法撤回。";
"Send diagnostic test" = "发送诊断测试";
"Diagnostic test queued. Delivery depends on network availability." = "诊断测试已进入发送队列，是否送达取决于网络状况。";

/* Unified server credentials */
"macOS could not validate this application while reading Keychain. Use a trusted, consistently signed build. Your saved password has not been changed." = "macOS 读取钥匙链时未能验证此应用。请使用可信且签名一致的版本。已保存的密码没有被更改。";
"Enter the server password once. It is saved in Keychain and reused when connecting." = "首次输入服务器密码后会保存到钥匙链，后续连接会自动使用。";

/* NFS user mounts and reserved-port compatibility */
"NAS requires a reserved source port" = "NAS 要求保留源端口";
"Enable only if your NAS requires reserved source ports. These mounts use /Volumes and require administrator authorization. Saving does not authorize." = "仅在确认 NAS 要求保留源端口时开启。此模式挂载到 /Volumes，需要管理员授权；保存配置不会发起授权。";
"The installed NFS helper is used for reserved-port mounts." = "保留端口模式将使用已安装的 NFS 挂载助手。";
"Authorizing installs a persistent passwordless NFS helper for your macOS user. It is not restricted to this app." = "授权会为当前 macOS 用户安装持久免密码 NFS 挂载助手，此权限不局限于本应用。";
"Authorize once for automatic NFS mounts…" = "为 NFS 自动挂载进行一次性授权…";
"NFS mounts in ~/NetworkMounts without administrator authorization. The NAS must allow non-reserved source ports." = "NFS 默认挂载到 ~/NetworkMounts，无需管理员授权；NAS 必须允许非保留源端口。";
"Could not authorize NFS mounting" = "NFS 挂载授权失败";
"Could not install the NFS helper. You can still save the server configuration without authorizing." = "无法安装 NFS 挂载助手，仍可在不授权的情况下保存服务器配置。";
"Reserved-port NFS mounting needs administrator authorization. Open the server settings and authorize automatic NFS mounts, or disable reserved-port mode if the NAS allows it." = "保留端口 NFS 挂载需要管理员授权。请在服务器设置中授权自动挂载；如果 NAS 允许，也可关闭保留端口模式。";

// Classified NFS failures; never include raw tool output.
"NFS mount failed (exit status %d). %@" = "NFS 挂载失败（退出状态 %d）。%@";
"The NFS tool did not provide a recognized failure reason. Check the NAS export permissions and connection; do not enable reserved-port mode based on the exit status alone." = "NFS 工具未提供可识别的失败原因。请检查 NAS 导出权限和网络连接；不要仅根据退出状态启用保留端口模式。";
"macOS or the NFS server denied permission. Check mount-directory ownership and NAS export/client permissions. Reserved-port mode requires administrator authorization and should only be enabled if the NAS requires it." = "macOS 或 NFS 服务器拒绝了访问。请检查挂载目录的所有权以及 NAS 的导出和客户端权限。保留端口模式需要管理员授权，仅在 NAS 要求时启用。";
"The NFS export or local mount directory was not found. Check the export path and mount directory." = "未找到 NFS 导出或本地挂载目录。请检查导出路径和挂载目录。";
"The NFS request timed out. Check the network, firewall and NAS NFS service." = "NFS 请求超时。请检查网络、防火墙和 NAS 的 NFS 服务。";
"The NFS service could not be reached. Check the server address, network, firewall and NAS NFS service." = "无法连接 NFS 服务。请检查服务器地址、网络、防火墙和 NAS 的 NFS 服务。";
"The NFS tool rejected its arguments. This may be an application or helper compatibility problem, not a server-password error." = "NFS 工具拒绝了命令参数。这可能是应用或辅助工具的兼容性问题，而不是服务器密码错误。";
"macOS did not authorize the reserved-port NFS tool. Review NFS administrator authorization in the server settings, or disable reserved-port mode if the NAS allows it." = "macOS 未授权保留端口 NFS 工具。请在服务器设置中检查 NFS 管理员授权，或在 NAS 允许时关闭保留端口模式。";
"NFS administrator authorization was cancelled. No server password was changed." = "已取消 NFS 管理员授权。服务器密码未被修改。";
